cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use sealsim, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "sealsim: SEnsory Aquatic odometry simuLator"
abstract: >-
  Agent-based simulation of the optic flow a swimming harbour seal (Phoca vitulina)
  receives from suspended particles in turbid water. A six-degree-of-freedom seal
  agent moves through a seed-stable particle cloud; the package computes great-circle
  retinal flow and three odometry readouts (focus-of-expansion heading error,
  depth-order rank correlation, translation-rotation index) over sweeps of particle
  density, visual acuity, current and depth, on CPU or CUDA.
version: "1.0.0"
